  "body": "From #138:\n\n> In writable-stream-abort.js, 'Aborting a WritableStream causes ...' test is testing a WritableStream in writable state which now returns a pending promise which gets rejected but this should be a fulfilled promise to be consistent with the initial value of [[state]] that is 'writable'. We need to fix this behavior later but for now just put the WritableStream in 'waiting' state and test what stated in the test description.\n",
